    "text": "By Mark Nesbitt ,\n1 days ago The Oregon boys soccer team posted two shutouts and won two road games last week. Oregon (3-3, 2-0 Badger Large) rolled by Pewaukee 4-0 on Saturday, Sept. 13, in Pewaukee. The Panthers were coming off a 1-0 Badger Large Conference road win over Waunakee on Tuesday, Sept. 9, at Warrior Stadium. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
